# Instruments Domain and API Keys

RULE: All instrument reads via InstrumentsDomainClient (unified-domain-services). API keys via get_secret_with_fallback, never os.getenv.
WHY: Single source of truth; no duplicate GCS reads or fallbacks in services.
CODEX: 02-data/instruments-and-api-keys-standard.md

DO:
  from unified_domain_services import InstrumentsDomainClient
  api_key = get_secret_with_fallback(project_id=..., secret_name=..., fallback_env_var="TARDIS_API_KEY")

NEVER:
  os.environ.get("TARDIS_API_KEY")
  Direct GCS reads for instruments; duplicate _load_instruments_by_venue in services
